<title>FINLAND: Aspo to expand Tallinn oil terminal.</title>
<headline>Aspo to expand Tallinn oil terminal.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals and electronics component group Aspoyhtyma Oy said on Monday its AS Sonmarin unit will quadruple its oil terminal capacity in Tallinn, Estonia.</p>
<p>The volume of the new oil storage facility will be 46,000 cubic metres (290,000 barrels), it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Aspoyhtyma said the new storage facility will be completed early next year.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
</text>
